1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,290
Did you know...

2
00:00:01,290 --> 00:00:03,430
out of every 5 phones sold,

3
00:00:03,430 --> 00:00:05,510
only one is an iPhone...

4
00:00:05,510 --> 00:00:07,680
but Apple takes almost 80%

5
00:00:07,680 --> 00:00:09,580
of all the profit?

6
00:00:09,580 --> 00:00:10,660
Crazy, right?

7
00:00:10,660 --> 00:00:12,850
Here's how, in 40 seconds.

8
00:00:12,850 --> 00:00:13,560
One.

9
00:00:13,560 --> 00:00:14,910
Apple makes its own parts

10
00:00:14,910 --> 00:00:16,360
and its own software.

11
00:00:16,360 --> 00:00:18,250
So Apple decides the cost...

12
00:00:18,250 --> 00:00:19,440
and the price.

13
00:00:19,440 --> 00:00:20,040
Two.

14
00:00:20,040 --> 00:00:20,930
After the iPhone,

15
00:00:20,930 --> 00:00:22,100
you buy AirPods...

16
00:00:22,100 --> 00:00:23,610
a Watch... iCloud.

17
00:00:23,610 --> 00:00:25,980
Everything works so well together...

18
00:00:25,980 --> 00:00:27,880
that leaving feels painful.

19
00:00:27,880 --> 00:00:28,980
This is called...

20
00:00:28,980 --> 00:00:30,360
a walled garden.

21
00:00:30,360 --> 00:00:31,020
Three.

22
00:00:31,020 --> 00:00:32,420
Buy an app or a subscription

23
00:00:32,420 --> 00:00:33,380
on iPhone...

24
00:00:33,380 --> 00:00:34,870
and Apple quietly takes

25
00:00:34,870 --> 00:00:36,500
up to 30%.

26
00:00:36,500 --> 00:00:37,490
So Apple doesn't just

27
00:00:37,490 --> 00:00:38,780
sell you a phone.

28
00:00:38,780 --> 00:00:40,480
It keeps earning from you...

29
00:00:40,480 --> 00:00:42,190
every single month.

30
00:00:42,190 --> 00:00:43,610
Follow for one more why,

31
00:00:43,610 --> 00:00:44,900
every day.

